WEBVTT

00:00:03.193 --> 00:00:07.389
Open Content, Export, and choose the Contact type.

00:00:07.389 --> 00:00:13.533
Besides the usual filters, a contact type shows a CRM last activity section.

00:00:13.984 --> 00:00:19.145
Tick Include last completed activity information, and choose a subject, and the file

00:00:19.145 --> 00:00:23.503
appends each contact's most recent completed activity of that subject:

00:00:23.503 --> 00:00:29.237
the agent's note, the completion date, the disposition, the subject, and the subject's fields.

00:00:29.237 --> 00:00:33.653
Tick Include only contacts with a last activity record to leave out the

00:00:33.653 --> 00:00:35.373
contacts that have none.

00:00:35.373 --> 00:00:38.584
This is a quick way to prepare the next call list.

